I have written a program to help design Tesla Coils.  For those who
don't know, Tesla Coils are used to experiment with high voltage, high
frequency electricity.  You can simulate lightning with a Tesla Coil,
and it is easy to generate sparks of a foot or more.  Sometimes a lot
more :-)

Safety is very important, of course, so if you decide to try this hobby,
make sure you know what you are doing first.  There is a lot of relevent
info on the net, browse http://www.funet.fi/pub/sci/electrical/tesla to
get started.

