terms of the GNU Public License.  It performs all the necessary math,
and provides a lot of help to explain the concepts. 

You can currently find it at:

ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/Incoming/ntesla-1.6.tar.gz

It will probably move to:

ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/apps/circuits/ntesla-1.6.tar.gz

A pre-compiled binary is included in the archive for your convenience.

