Version:        0.91
Entered-date:   26APR97
Description:    Self-contained FTP site monitor & mirroring program
Keywords:       ftp mirror
Author:         dark@mama.indstate.edu (Thomas J. Moore)
Maintained-by:  dark@mama.indstate.edu (Thomas J. Moore)
Primary-site:   sunsite.unc.edu /pub/Linux/system/Network/file-transfer
		33K lurkftp-0.91.tar.gz
Copying-policy: GPL
End

Have fun!

