To SUBSCRIBE to this mailing list, simply send a message with the word
"subscribe" in the Subject: field to

    mailto:fgate-users-request@gondor.gun.de

To UNSUBSCRIBE from this mailing list, simply send a message with the
word (you guessed it :-) "unsubscribe" in the Subject: field to
fgate-users-request@gondor.gun.de

