          * Linux x86
          * Solaris 2.5 sparc
          * Solaris 2.5 x86
          
FEATURES:
- ---------
 
   1. XAUDIO Library
      * Portable MPEG Audio Layer I and Layer II support.
      * Generic audio device support & file output.
      * C code optimization (runs faster than other implementations).
      * Pentium assembler optimization.
      * Tested on x86, sparc, powerPC.
      * Full random access to the bitstream.
      * Full audio control (mono, stereo, volume, balance, etc...)
      * Error robustness.
      
   2. XAUDIO Motif GUI
      * First native GUI for a unix MPEG audio player.
      * Generic motif 1.2 calls (will run on any motif implementation).
      * Multiple dynamic panels.
      * Interactive trackbar control for direct seek.
      * Interactive audio controls.
      * Minimal playlist support (undocumented).
      
 
   3. XAUDIO Windows GUI
      * Multithreaded decoding.
      * Multiple dynamic panels.
      * Interactive trackbar control for direct seek.
      * Interactive audio controls.
      * Drag & Drop support.
      * InstallShield (tm) archive distribution.


