-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----


This program is used to drive the LED display described in the
led-stat.txt file that comes with this archive.  It is different from
most other meters on the market(?) in that it displays the CPU idle
time, as opposed to the load average.  It uses the /proc filesystem to
gather its data. It has to option to include a "heartbeat" similar to
the HP9000 workstations, and an option to vary the beat with the load
average.

This version differs from the earlier version in a couple ways:
   - The ugly beatmask has been removed.  I /knew/ there had to
     be bitwise operators! <grin> How stOOpid of me!
   - Added beat scaling - The heartbeat is faster with a higher 
     load average.
   - BEATLENGHT is a percentage, now.


Begin3
