		Keeper) and includes support for playing sound files to
		notify users of incoming talk requests (by Craig Schenk).
		Also searches utmp file for active tty to display talk
		request to (by Daniel Barlowe). New: allows the talker to
		leave a message mailed to the callee if he doesn't answer 
		or isn't logged (by David Faure).
